#: ../../source/index.md:1
msgid "FlagOS-Compressor Documentation"
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 文档"

#: ../../source/index.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor is a checkpoint conversion and quantization tool for "
"local [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/docs) `safetensors` model "
"directories."
msgstr ""
"FlagOS-Compressor 是一个用于转换检查点和量化本地 "
"[Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/docs) `safetensors` 模型目录的工具。"

#: ../../source/index.md:5
msgid ""
"Use this documentation to install the tool, quantize model weights, "
"convert checkpoints, calibrate outputs, and validate generated artifacts."
msgstr ""
"使用本文档安装工具、量化模型权重、转换检查点、校准输出，并验证生成的产物。"

#: ../../source/index.md:7
msgid "Start here"
msgstr "从这里开始"

#: ../../source/index.md:14
msgid "Run your first quantization"
msgstr "执行第一次量化"

#: ../../source/index.md:18
msgid ""
"Follow one complete inspect -> quantize -> validate path with a local "
"model directory."
msgstr ""
"按照一条完整的检查 -> 量化 -> 验证流程处理本地模型目录。"

#: ../../source/index.md:21
msgid "Install and prepare the CLI"
msgstr "安装并准备命令行工具"

#: ../../source/index.md:25
msgid ""
"Set up dependencies, optional extras, and the command-line entrypoint "
"before running a job."
msgstr ""
"在运行任务前配置依赖、可选扩展和命令行入口。"

#: ../../source/index.md:29
msgid "Common workflows"
msgstr "常见工作流"

#: ../../source/index.md:36
msgid "Quantize weights"
msgstr "量化权重"

#: ../../source/index.md:40
msgid "Run weight-only quantization with a recipe or explicit CLI options."
msgstr "使用配方或显式的命令行选项执行仅权重量化。"

#: ../../source/index.md:43
msgid "Calibrate models"
msgstr "校准模型"

#: ../../source/index.md:47
msgid "Collect calibration data and use it for quantization workflows."
msgstr "收集校准数据，并将其用于量化工作流。"

#: ../../source/index.md:50
msgid "Select layers"
msgstr "选择层"

#: ../../source/index.md:54
msgid "Target modules with selectors, regex rules, and policy constraints."
msgstr "使用选择器、正则表达式规则和策略约束定位模块。"

#: ../../source/index.md:57
msgid "Validate outputs"
msgstr "验证输出"

#: ../../source/index.md:61
msgid "Check generated artifacts before loading or publishing a compressed model."
msgstr "在加载或发布压缩模型前检查生成的产物。"

#: ../../source/index.md:64
msgid "Convert FP4 and FP8"
msgstr "转换 FP4 和 FP8"

#: ../../source/index.md:68
msgid "Convert low-precision checkpoint formats back to BF16 when needed."
msgstr "根据需要将低精度检查点格式转换回 BF16。"

#: ../../source/index.md:71
msgid "Troubleshoot failures"
msgstr "排查故障"

#: ../../source/index.md:75
msgid "Recover from common configuration, validation, and model-family issues."
msgstr "解决常见的配置、验证和模型系列问题。"
